# Digital LDQ.

**Authors:** Boone, Randy, Higgins, Kyle, Edyburn, Dave

## Abstract
This article discusses the creation of an archive that permits online access to digital copies of back issues of the &quot;Learning Disability Quarterly.&quot; It describes how to access the archive, select and order an issue, and the benefits of providing information in digital formats. (Contains 3 references.) (CR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ667933

